      "content_md": "![Image](http://4c-s.org/dinesh/holo_photos/photos/Gallery/Buddha.jpg)\n\n*[Photo by JP]*\n\n**Type:** This is a 4\"x5\" Denisyuk.\n\n**Film:** PFG-01 film.\n\n**Developer:**JD-2.\n\n**Laser:** 16\" Melles Griot Hene 15mW OEM putting out 7mW (random pol.) \n\n**Exposure:** 3 seconds.\n\nThe image appears rather green due to being a bit over exposed and the angle that the picture was taken. The illumination source is a Halogen light.\n\n*[editied to ref new path to image]*",
